<li about="#cite_note-bparl-90" id="cite_note-bparl-90" data-mw-footnote-number="90"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwB6g"><a href="./آثار_استخدام_البنزوديازيبين_على_المدى_الطويل#cite_ref-bparl_90-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwB6k"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwB6o">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-bparl-90" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r70318604" about="#mwt289" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"استشهاد بويب","href":"./قالب:استشهاد_بويب"},"params":{"مسار":{"wt":"http://www.parliament.the-stationery-office.co.uk/pa/cm199900/cmhansrd/vo991207/halltext/91207h02.htm"},"عنوان":{"wt":"Benzodiazepines"},"مؤلف":{"wt":"Mr. Phil Woolas"},"مؤلف-وصلة":{"wt":"Phil Woolas"},"مؤلف2":{"wt":"Mr. John Hutton"},"مؤلف2-وصلة":{"wt":"John Hutton (Labour MP)"},"تاريخ":{"wt":"7 Dec 1999"},"ناشر":{"wt":"www.parliament.uk"},"مكان":{"wt":"England"},"اقتباس":{"wt":"The story of benzodiazepines is of awesome proportions and has been described as a national scandal. The impact is so large that it is too big for Governments, regulatory authorities, and the pharmaceutical industry to address head on, so the scandal has been swept under the carpet. My reasons for bringing the debate to the Chamber are numerous and reflect the many strands that weave through the issue."},"مسار أرشيف":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160303202735/http://www.parliament.the-stationery-office.co.uk/pa/cm199900/cmhansrd/vo991207/halltext/91207h02.htm"},"تاريخ أرشيف":{"wt":"3 مارس 2016"}},"i":0}}]}' id="mwB6s"/><cite id="CITEREFMr._Phil_WoolasMr._John_Hutton1999" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt289"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Phil_Woolas?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Phil Woolas" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Phil Woolas"]}}' id="mwB6w">Mr. Phil Woolas</a>؛ <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./John_Hutton_(Labour_MP)?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="John Hutton (Labour MP)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["John Hutton (Labour MP)"]}}' id="mwB60">Mr. John Hutton</a> (7 ديسمبر 1999). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160303202735/http://www.parliament.the-stationery-office.co.uk/pa/cm199900/cmhansrd/vo991207/halltext/91207h02.htm" class="external text" id="mwB64">"Benzodiazepines"</a>. England: www.parliament.uk. مؤرشف من <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.parliament.the-stationery-office.co.uk/pa/cm199900/cmhansrd/vo991207/halltext/91207h02.htm" class="external text" id="mwB68">الأصل</a> في 2016-03-03. <q id="mwB7A">The story of benzodiazepines is of awesome proportions and has been described as a national scandal. The impact is so large that it is too big for Governments, regulatory authorities, and the pharmaceutical industry to address head on, so the scandal has been swept under the carpet. My reasons for bringing the debate to the Chamber are numerous and reflect the many strands that weave through the issue.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Benzodiazepines&amp;rft.place=England&amp;rft.pub=www.parliament.uk&amp;rft.date=1999-12-07&amp;rft.au=Mr.+Phil+Woolas&amp;rft.au=Mr.+John+Hutton&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.parliament.the-stationery-office.co.uk%2Fpa%2Fcm199900%2Fcmhansrd%2Fvo991207%2Fhalltext%2F91207h02.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Far.wikipedia.org%3A%D8%A2%D8%AB%D8%A7%D8%B1+%D8%A7%D8%B3%D8%AA%D8%AE%D8%AF%D8%A7%D9%85+%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D9%86%D8%B2%D9%88%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%B2%D9%8A%D8%A8%D9%8A%D9%86+%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%89+%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%AF%D9%89+%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B7%D9%88%D9%8A%D9%84" class="Z3988" about="#mwt289" id="mwB7E"></span></span></li>
